            %p
              which carries the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/structure"} structure
              both of a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/monad"} monad
              and of a
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/comonad"} comonad
            %p We claim that
            %ol
              %li
                %p the categories of
                %ol
                  %li
                    %p
                      %a{:href => "algebra+over+a+monad#FreeAlgebras"}
                        free
                        = succeed "-algebras" do
                          %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
