                      %mi B
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} B \times B
              = succeed ")." do
                %a{:href => "Kleisli+category#InTermsOfKleisliMorphisms"} here
            %p
              Moreover, the second statement follows by direct inspection of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kleisli+morphisms"} Kleisli morphisms
              (and
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/formal+duality"} dually
              for the
              = succeed "):" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coKleisli+morphisms"} coKleisli morphisms
            %p
