                        %mi b
                        %mo{:lspace => "verythinmathspace"} :
                        %mi B
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (F_b)_{b \colon B}
              that it evidently encodes.
            %p
              Observe that the comultiplication on the
              = succeed "-" do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %msub
