              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "necessity+and+possibility#ModalQuantumLogic"} modal quantum logic
              = succeed "):" do
                %a{:href => "quantum+circuits+via+dependent+linear+types#CQTS22"} CQTS (2022)
            %div{:style => "margin: -10px 0px 20px 10px"}
              %img{:src => "/nlab/files/QCwthLHT-QuantumModalUnits-221021b.jpg", :width => "750px"}/
            %p
              Using this, one readily sees that the Kleisli construction indeed sends such
              = succeed "-tuples" do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
